ard Bandler",phonebook_id:14457,first_name:bT,middle_name:bb,last_name:"Bandler",sl_suffix:a,org_code:b_,isTeam:m},{recipient_name:"Terra Hardwick",phonebook_id:a,first_name:a,middle_name:a,last_name:a,sl_suffix:a,org_code:aB,isTeam:e},{recipient_name:"Jenna Criswell",phonebook_id:a,first_name:a,middle_name:a,last_name:a,sl_suffix:a,org_code:aB,isTeam:e}]}},{day:$,month:E,year:D,id:1181,sort:ap,date:ap,title:"Exceptional Achievement for Safety Award",description:a,url:a,image:a,honor_text:a,honoree_format:m,body_url:a,body_url_text:a,other_url:a,other_url_text:a,recipient_urls:[],recipients:{scoped:[],all:[{recipient_name:"Anthony Gritsavage",phonebook_id:a,first_name:a,middle_name:a,last_name:a,sl_suffix:a,org_code:aB,isTeam:e}]}},{day:$,month:E,year:D,id:1170,sort:ap,date:ap,title:"Robert H. Goddard Tribute Award",description:a,url:a,image:a,honor_text:a,honoree_format:m,body_url:a,body_url_text:a,other_url:a,other_url_text:a,recipient_urls:[],recipients:{scoped:[],all:[{recipient_name:"Anthony J Martino",phonebook_id:18434,first_name:cc,middle_name:aX,last_name:"Martino",sl_suffix:a,org_code:kx,isTeam:m},{recipient_name:"David J Thompson",phonebook_id:9236,first_name:X,middle_name:aX,last_name:kE,sl_suffix:b,org_code:z,isTeam:m}]}},{day:$,month:E,year:D,id:1176,sort:ap,date:ap,title:"GSFC Honor Award – Education, Outreach, Mentorship Excellence Award",description:a,url:a,image:a,honor_text:a,honoree_format:m,body_url:a,body_url_text:a,other_url:a,other_url_text:a,recipient_urls:[],recipients:{scoped:[],all:[{recipient_name:"James G Acker",phonebook_id:17942,first_name:bc,middle_name:cR,last_name:"Acker",sl_suffix:a,org_code:fx,isTeam:m}]}},{day:$,month:E,year:D,id:1177,sort:ap,date:ap,title:"GSFC Honor Award – Excellence in Innovation",description:a,url:a,image:a,honor_text:a,honoree_format:m,body_url:a,body_url_text:a,other_url:a,other_url_text:a,recipient_urls:[],recipients:{scoped:[],all:[{recipient_name:"Jared Ryan Ralleta",phonebook_id:124871,first_name:ra,middle_name:dx,last_name:"Ralleta",sl_suffix:a,org_code:aA,isTeam:m}]}},{day:J,month:R,year:D,id:1184,sort:rb,date:rb,title:"John C. Lindsay Memorial Award for Space Science",description:"The John C. Lindsay Memorial Award recognizes a scientist whose recent contributions have had a substantial, lasting impact on space science. Dr. Arge is recognized for his recent, high-impact contribution to the solar \"open magnetic flux problem,\" one of the most persistent and consequential unsolved puzzles in Heliophysics. Dr. Arge’s work exemplifies the transformation of basic scientific discovery into validated, operational capability. For his creative and rigorous resolution to this longstanding space science problem, and for the sustained international impact of his modeling work, he is exceptionally deserving of this honor. \u003Cbr\u003E",url:a,image:"\u002Fimages\u002Faward_thumbs\u002FAwardID_1184.jpg",honor_text:a,honoree_format:m,body_url:a,body_url_text:a,other_url:a,other_url_text:a,recipient_urls:[],recipients:{scoped:[],all:[{recipient_name:"Charles Nickolos Arge",phonebook_id:rc,first_name:bp,middle_name:kF,last_name:kG,sl_suffix:a,org_code:ab,isTeam:m}]}},{day:$,month:Q,year:D,id:1167,sort:rd,date:rd,title:"William Nordberg Memorial Award for Earth Science",description:"Dr. Jeremy Werdell is awarded the 2026 Nordberg Award for Earth Science for his groundbreaking work in ocean color remote sensing and for his successful leadership of NASA’s PACE mission for which he has been Project Scientist since 2012. His scientific vision, leadership, and exceptional community-building brought PACE from concept to orbit to transformative science. His efforts in improving ocean color remote sensing have led to internationally adopted algorithms and have influenced the design and validation of many missions. In addition, Dr. Werdell’s extensive efforts at mentorship and education—advising postdoctoral fellows, designing early-career training courses, serving on university faculty—help ensure and sustain the future of ocean remote sensing.",url:a,image:"\u002Fimages\u002Faward_thumbs\u002FAwardID_1167.png",honor_text:a,honoree_format:m,body_url:a,body_url_text:a,other_url:a,other_url_text:a,recipient_urls:[],recipients:{scoped:[],all:[{recipient_name:"Jeremy Werdell",phonebook_id:22097,first_name:hy,middle_name:b,last_name:"Werdell",sl_suffix:b,org_code:ky,isTeam:m}]}},{day:cC,month:c,year:D,id:1163,sort:hz,date:hz,title:"Editor Award - Journal of Hydrometeorology",description:"For polite, meticulous, and insightful reviews",url:hA,image:a,honor_text:a,honoree_format:m,body_url:hA,body_url_text:re,other_url:a,other_url_text:a,recipient_urls:[],recipients:{scoped:[],all:[{recipient_name:"Ali Tokay",phonebook_id:17934,first_name:"Ali",middle_name:b,last_name:"Tokay",sl_suffix:a,org_code:fw,isTeam:m}]}},{day:cC,month:c,year:D,id:1164,sort:hz,date:hz,title:"Editor Award – The Journal of Atmospheric and Oceanic Technology",description:"For timely, technically detailed, and comprehensive reviews",url:hA,image:a,honor_text:a,honoree_format:m,body_url:hA,body_url_text:re,other_url:a,other_url_text:a,recipient_urls:[],recipients:{scoped:[],all:[{recipient_name:"Fraser King",phonebook_id:127193,first_name:"Fraser",middle_name:b,last_name:rf,sl_suffix:b,org_code:fw,isTeam:m}]}},{day:a,month:a,year:D,id:1166,sort:rg,date:rg,title:"Marzano Award Gutta Aurea",description:"A recognition aiming to acknowledge outstanding contributions from individuals in remote sensing, atmospheric sciences, meteorology, and telecommunications. \"For significant contributions towards improved estimates of snowfall from satellite-based passive and active microwave observations\"",url:rh,image:"\u002Fimages\u002Faward_thumbs\u002FAwardID_1166.png",honor_text:a,honoree_format:m,body_url:rh,body_url_text:"Association of Prof. FS Marzano",other_url:a,other_url_text:a,recipient_urls:[],recipients:{scoped:[],all:[{recipient_name:"Lisa Milani",phonebook_id:83753,first_name:ri,middle_name:b,last_name:"Milani",sl_suffix:b,org_code:fw,isTeam:m}]}},{day:dy,month:s,year:eF,id:1145,sort:rj,date:rj,title:"GISS Best Publication Award",description:"The article \" Modeling atmospheric brown carbon in the GISS ModelE Earth system model\" by Maggie DeLessio et al.. was voted the best research publication by the science staff of Goddard Institute for Space Studies to have been published in 2024. The paper appeared in Atmospheric Chemistry and Physics.",url:rk,image:"\u002Fimages\u002Faward_thumbs\u002FAwardID_1145.png",honor_text:a,honoree_format:m,body_url:rk,body_url_text:"GISS Best Publications Award",other_url:a,other_url_text:a,recipient_urls:[],recipients:{scoped:[],all:[{recipient_name:"Maegan Anne DeLessio",phonebook_id:100990,first_name:"Maegan",middle_name:fB,last_name:"DeLessio",sl_suffix:a,org_code:eD,isTeam:m}]}},{day:a,month:s,year:eF,id:1146,sort:rl,date:rl,title:"AAS Goddard Symposium Earth Science and Applications Award",description:"Recognizing their groundbreaking contributions to Earth observations and celebrating the teams' enduring impact and NASA Goddard’s leadership in advancing Earth Science for the Nation",url:rm,image:a,honor_text:a,honoree_format:m,body_url:rm,body_url_text:"American Astronautical Society",other_url:a,other_url_text:a,recipient_urls:[],recipients:{scoped:[],all:[{recipient_name:"Aqua MODIS Science and Instrument Team",phonebook_id:a,first_name:a,middle_name:a,last_name:a,sl_suffix:a,org_code:ay,isTeam:e},{recipient_name:"Terra MODIS Science and Instrument Team",phonebook_id:a,first_name:a,middle_name:a,last_name:a,sl_suffix:a,org_code:ay,isTeam:e}]}},{day:a,month:u,year:eF,id:1144,sort:rn,date:rn,title:"Outstanding Environmental Researcher",description:"\"For your significant contribution to our understanding of the evolution of, carbon sequestration in, and sedimentation in Hudson River marshes. Your passion as a mentor has led countless graduate students into scientific research.",url:ro,image:a,honor_text